<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell - May 21 week.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell - May 21 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED MAY 21</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............814,500 down.....100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......719,000 down...2,700</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......548,900 down...6,000</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....854,370 up.....2,739</p>
<p> Financial companies.......661,339 up.....2,516</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,272 up.......191</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......46,016 up.......199</p>
</text>
